# Design <!-- NOTE: kinten -->

## Design goals

1. How to direct users to act courteously via UX?
2. How to write clean maintainable code with high performance?
3. How to minimize layering in architecture?

## Use case

1. Article lifecycle
2. Authentication & account
3. Content consumption
4. Discussions
5. Issues
6. Pull requests
7. Moderation
8. Notes

