# Realization <!-- NOTE: khang -->

## Technologies

- Front-end: Reason & React
- Back-end: Elixir
- Front-end Hosting: Firebase
- Back-end Hosting: Render; Google Cloud
- Database: Firestore

<<<

### Inline markup

Writing layout markup in same place as application code

```reason
let makeComponent = () => {
	let message = "hi";
	<div className="label">
		{message}
	</div>
}
```

<<<

### Self-documentation

- Incentivize writing documentations
- Possibly subjective

